('0628549001', '0628549', 'MICHAEL set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a bodysuit and trousers in jersey made from an organic cotton blend. Bodysuit with a sewn-on bow tie, short sleeves with sewn-in turn-ups, a sewn-on waistcoat with buttons down the front, and press-studs at the shoulders and crotch. Trousers with foldover ribbing at the waist and ribbed hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628556001', '0628556', 'TUXEDO set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a bodysuit and trousers in a soft organic cotton blend. Long-sleeved bodysuit with a collar, shirt front, sewn-on bow tie, button placket and press-studs at the crotch. Trousers with foldover ribbing at the waist, a fake fly and ribbed hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628561001', '0628561', 'THYME jacket2', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Greenish Khaki', 'Dark', 'Woven', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Edition', 'Shirts', 'Jacket in a crisp cotton and nylon blend with a stand-up collar and zip and wind flap with concealed buttons down the front. Flap chest and front pockets with concealed buttons and an adjustable fastening at the cuffs. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628564001', '0628564', 'LITTLE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a top and pair of trousers in soft organic cotton. Jersey top with long raglan sleeves, buttons on one shoulder, an open chest pocket and contrasting colour neckline. Trousers in woven fabric with wide, foldover ribbing at the waist, a fake fly, leg pocket with a decorative button, and elasticated hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628568001', '0628568', 'Peggy Padded Jacket', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Outdoor/Blazers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Outdoor', 'Padded, gently fitted jacket in woven fabric with a lined, faux fur-trimmed hood, zip down the front and elastic drawstring at the waist. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, discreet side pockets and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Slightly longer at the back. Lined. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628568002', '0628568', 'Peggy Padded Jacket', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Outdoor/Blazers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Outdoor', 'Padded, gently fitted jacket in woven fabric with a lined, faux fur-trimmed hood, zip down the front and elastic drawstring at the waist. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, discreet side pockets and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Slightly longer at the back. Lined. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628568003', '0628568', 'Peggy Padded Jacket', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Red', 'Medium', 'Outdoor/Blazers', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Collection', 'Outdoor', 'Padded, gently fitted jacket in woven fabric with a lined, faux fur-trimmed hood, zip down the front and elastic drawstring at the waist. Handwarmer pockets with a press-stud, discreet side pockets and inner ribbing at the cuffs. Slightly longer at the back. Lined. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628586001', '0628586', 'PUMPKIN sports bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Bras', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Sports bra in fast-drying functional fabric with mesh details and lightly padded cups with removable inserts. Wide shoulder straps that cross at the back and a wide elasticated hem. Light support.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628586002', '0628586', 'PUMPKIN sports bra', 'Bra', 'Underwear', 'All over pattern', 'White', 'Light', 'Ladies Sport Bras', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Sports bra in fast-drying functional fabric with mesh details and lightly padded cups with removable inserts. Wide shoulder straps that cross at the back and a wide elasticated hem. Light support.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628591001', '0628591', 'ANISE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Blouse and puff pants in a cotton weave. Sleeveless blouse with buttons at the back and a wide flounce at the hem. Puff pants with an elasticated waist and elasticated hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628591002', '0628591', 'ANISE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Blouse and puff pants in a cotton weave. Sleeveless blouse with buttons at the back and a wide flounce at the hem. Puff pants with an elasticated waist and elasticated hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628593001', '0628593', 'ACE jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Woven', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Unknown', 'Outdoor jacket in fast-drying, functional rustle fabric with a drawstring hood, stand-up collar and zip down the front. Long sleeves with elasticated cuffs, side pockets with a press-stud and a ribbed, elasticated hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628594001', '0628594', 'SERENA SET', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Mixed solid/pattern', 'Red', 'Bright', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Set with a sleeveless top, leggings and hairband in cotton. A-line top in woven fabric with an opening and button at the back of the neck and gathered flounce at the hem. Leggings in patterned jersey with an elasticated waist. Hairband in patterned jersey with a knot detail at the front and elastication at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628608001', '0628608', 'AMBER vest set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Check', 'Dark Red', 'Medium', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Set with a dress, gilet and a pair of leggings. Flared dress in woven fabric with front pockets, buttons at the back and long sleeves with narrow elastication at the cuffs. Faux fur gilet with a concealed button at the top. Lined. Jersey leggings with an elasticated waist.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628610001', '0628610', 'LUELLA romper set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Baby Girl Woven', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Set with a top and dungarees in soft cotton. Top in patterned jersey with a press-stud on one shoulder. Dungarees in a crinkled weave with flounces at the front, elastication at the back of the shoulder straps, press-studs at the crotch and down the legs (not in sizes 1-3Y) and elasticated hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628621001', '0628621', 'BJARNE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Front print', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a hooded jacket and pair of trousers in soft sweatshirt fabric made from an organic cotton blend. Jacket with a zip down the front, chin guard, ribbing at the cuffs and hem and a jersey-lined hood with sewn-on ears at the top. Trousers with wide, foldover ribbing at the waist and ribbed hems. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628621003', '0628621', 'BJARNE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Application/3D', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a hooded jacket and pair of trousers in soft sweatshirt fabric made from an organic cotton blend. Jacket with a zip down the front, chin guard, ribbing at the cuffs and hem and a jersey-lined hood with sewn-on ears at the top. Trousers with wide, foldover ribbing at the waist and ribbed hems. Soft brushed inside.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0628631001', '0628631', 'Blake Slim LInen Blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen weave with narrow notch lapels, a decorative buttonhole and two buttons at the front. Chest pocket, welt front pockets and two inner pockets. Decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Partly lined. Slim Fit – a fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
