('0634978001', '0634978', 'DOT t-shirt', 'T-shirt', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Beige', 'Dark', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. T-shirt in soft jersey made from patterned organic cotton. Press-stud on one shoulder and an open chest pocket.', NULL, 0, 0);
