('0637374002', '0637374', 'Mina Espadrille', 'Flat shoe', 'Shoes', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Divided Shoes', 'Divided', 'Divided', 'Divided Accessories', 'Shoes', 'Satin espadrilles with a small platform, braided jute trim around the soles and a loop at the back. Fabric linings and insoles and rubber soles. Platform 3 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0637377001', '0637377', 'GAMMA shell jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Woven', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Unknown', 'Shell jacket in wind- and waterproof, breathable functional fabric with taped seams and waterproof zips. Hood with an elasticated drawstring and small peak, a stand-up collar and zip down the front with a chin guard. Zipped side pockets, a hook and loop tab at the cuffs and an elasticated drawstring at the hem. Unlined. The jacket has a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0637378001', '0637378', 'PULSAR shell trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Woven', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Unknown', 'Shell trousers in wind- and waterproof, breathable functional fabric with taped seams and waterproof zips. Adjustable hook and loop tabs at the sides, a zip fly with press-studs, and a waterproof, zipped leg pocket. Shaped legs with seams at the knees for optimum mobility and a zip and adjustable tab with press-studs at the hems. Unlined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0637394001', '0637394', 'Luna', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Sleeveless dress in a softly draping weave with a collar, concealed buttons down the front, flap chest pockets and a drawstring at the waist.', NULL, 0, 0),
