('0650626001', '0650626', 'Robin mix zip backpack', 'Bag', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Bags & Items', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Accessories', 'Accessories', 'Backpack in woven fabric with leather sections, a handle and adjustable, padded shoulder straps. Zip at the top, a zipped outer compartment, and two inner compartments, one with a zip. Padded back plate, and adjustable tabs with plastic fasteners at the sides and bottom. Lined. Size 15x30x42 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
