('0662287001', '0662287', 'Jaf jumpsuit', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'One-shoulder jumpsuit in a crêpe weave with a concealed zip in one side, a long sleeve and a wide cuff with covered buttons. Elasticated seam and a detachable tie belt at the waist, and tapered legs with a slit at the hems. Partly lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0662295001', '0662295', 'BB Bobbie bomber', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Young Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 134-170', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Jacket in nylon with a slight sheen. Ribbed stand-up collar, zip down the front, flap side pockets with a press-stud and a zipped sleeve pocket. Ribbing at the cuffs and hem. Jersey lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0662310001', '0662310', 'Johnson chunky runner', 'Sneakers', 'Shoes', 'Colour blocking', 'Dark Blue', 'Bright', 'Shoes', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Shoes', 'Shoes', 'Trainers in mesh, imitation leather and imitation suede with raised details, a padded top edge, lacing at the front and a loop front and back. Mesh linings and insoles and EVA (ethylene-vinyl acetate) and rubber soles.', NULL, 0, 0),
